- Prerequisite

Create a VM, size/SKU doesn't matter, it's just to have an example for creating the alerts.

---

Go to your selected VM and click on Monitoring in the overview page, then Alerts.

Click create then alert rule.

Select the VM in the scope section.
On the condition tab click on see all signals and select All Administrative operations and apply.
Action tab -> select use action groups -> Click create action group. Fill in resource group, action group name, and a display name.
Notification tab -> select Email/SMS message/Push/Voice in Notification type. Enter email then click Review + create and Create.





